" de incertidumbre?\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "We would use exactly the code from the example above, with\n"
msgstr "Usaríamos exactamente el código del ejemplo anterior, con\n"

